<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; background-color: white"><FONT STYLE="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">AgriFORCE&rsquo;s
organic growth plan to actively establish and deploy the commercialization of products, following the acquisition of the MNG IP, is focused
on four distinct phases:</FONT></P>

